          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kweethĩwa, ĩtina wa mathi, asu mauma kĩthimanĩ, na maenda na matavya mũsumbĩ Ndaviti; na mamwĩa Ndaviti, Ũkĩlai, mũinge manzĩ mĩtũkĩ; nũndũ Aithoveli nũtaanĩte ũu ĩũlũ wenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Ndaviti ookĩla, na andũ onthe ala maĩ nake, na mainga Yolotani: kĩoko kũikya kũtyatialĩte o na ũmwe wa asu ũtaingĩte Yolotani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla Aithoveli wonie ũtao wake ndwaaatĩĩwa, atandĩka ĩng’oi yake, na ookĩla, na enũka ndũanĩ yoo, na eeaa maũndũ ma nyũmba yake, na eesũsya mwene; na akw’a, na athikwa ngunganĩ ya ĩthe wake vala vathikawa akw’ũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
